# The jet scooter's maker on RoronF5: object $1B (loc_4288) with dialogue
# $87. ObjType_People sends $87 to loc_E690 (ps2.asm:20630): $1685, "I
# think I'm gonna try and ride this over the ocean ...", $C716 = 1 and
# the scooter parked at x $590, y $730 on Motavia ($C656, $C654). Before
# build 74 no $1B was spawned: he was not there and $C716 stayed 0.

start level $1E 6 6
wait screen level
wait idle
expect person $86 present
expect person $87 present
walk left 1
wait idle
walk down 38
wait idle
walk right 5
wait idle
walk down 11
wait idle
walk right 9
wait idle
walk left 2
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
press right                  # the maker, one cell east
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $1685
shot 01_over_the_ocean
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect screen level
expect flag $C716 1
expect no-stderr not ported
